TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium with fixed O2(g)
SOLUTION 1 Pure water pH 7
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    redox pe
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite   0    0.1
    Goethite 0    0
    Gypsum   0    0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file pyrite_ox.sel
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -molalities H+
END
